1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,400
上載示例單據；AI 讀出項目和金額，
翻譯成你選擇的語言，再用於分帳計算；原文保留核對。
Upload a sample receipt. AI extracts items and prices,
translates them into your app language for bill splitting,
and keeps the original text for review.

2
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:22,400
未有帳戶按 Sign up；已有帳戶直接登入。
Choose Sign up, or log in if you already have an account.

3
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:29,400
新用戶可選 Google，用 Gmail 登記。
New users can choose Google to sign up with Gmail.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,200
登入後開啟 API Keys，按 New Key 並命名，再設定有效期。
Open API Keys, select New Key, name it, and set its expiry.

5
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:51,800
有效期建議選一年，避免設定為永久。
A one-year expiry is recommended; avoid No expiration.

6
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:04,300
免費模型的額度設為 $0，可避免意外收費。
For free models, set the limit to $0 to avoid unexpected charges.

7
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:13,600
確認期限和額度後按 Create；新金鑰只完整顯示一次。
Review the expiry and limit, then select Create. The full key appears only once.

8
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:23,200
示範只用假金鑰：選標示 Free 的模型，輸入 API Key，再儲存並驗證。
Demo only: use a dummy key. Choose a Free model, enter it, and select Save & Verify.

9
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:32,400
金鑰只保存在本機；需要才啟用記住金鑰，切勿分享。
The key stays on this device. Enable Remember only if needed, and never share it.
